## Conventions (short)

- Dates: DB guest fields often `MM-DD-YYYY`; UI/query often `YYYY-MM-DD`. TZ: **Asia/Manila**.
- Secrets: `supabase/.env.local` — never commit or log tokens/PII.
- Imports: UI `@/`; edge relative `../_shared/...`.
- Prod Supabase deploy: blocked unless user says **`kamewave`** (`.cursor/rules/no-prod-deploy.mdc`).
- Dev/staging: **`docs/archive/operations/dev-staging-environment.md`** — separate Supabase account, Vercel Preview, `./dev.sh --ui-only --env dev`, `bun run deploy:supabase:dev`.

## Docs sync

Behavior changes → update matching docs in the same change (`.cursor/rules/documentation-maintenance.mdc`). Per-route → `docs/guides/routes/`.
